    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "ravi",
        "speaker": "Ravi",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 93,
        "text": "My slide says recycling increased by forty per cent. That should make a strong opening.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "3235495429f0c24494c9d96beb1f993365df1dafdb08a40035f63a5d463899a1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 101,
        "sourceEnd": 173,
        "text": "Forty per cent of what? Tell me the figures before and after the change.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "c6cb09acf21c4b08b3a8efede35e315f68ed38b32f2810d3232a515f7efb37b7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ravi",
        "speaker": "Ravi",
        "sourceStart": 180,
        "sourceEnd": 288,
        "text": "The fictional residence collected five hundred kilograms in the first month and seven hundred in the second.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "3765ec074399ccbad1b881acf32abba53d45bbe9823512ebbc2f2c11c6748147",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 296,
        "sourceEnd": 386,
        "text": "So the increase in collected weight is correct. Did the number of residents stay the same?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "ed1695d341e1d6c57c45297e96bf6a05611596cf3a30834d586d00f7bfb5a2f7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ravi",
        "speaker": "Ravi",
        "sourceStart": 393,
        "sourceEnd": 508,
        "text": "No. A new block opened, adding two hundred residents. I should show the population alongside the collection totals.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5afbd4f61b522836c442edf4216fb55e8175d99cfbf72af935b2404964e69461",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 516,
        "sourceEnd": 558,
        "text": "And was everything in the bins recyclable?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "70ad229b27bc9e2eb29c3fe9e0a45a92363572bdfc05ab3843e42299bfade525",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ravi",
        "speaker": "Ravi",
        "sourceStart": 565,
        "sourceEnd": 692,
        "text": "The contractor checked a sample and found some contamination. We cannot call the entire collected weight successfully recycled.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "9af63e298967d31128598224a8ddf050061f0c82fe1d61c46851831ae800f2b8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 700,
        "sourceEnd": 813,
        "text": "Good. Your title should describe collection, not the final processing outcome. What will your revised chart show?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "a481fbed7328e77c26121246b6a7efda9233542ab3d7705eb5cd0e79fbdb5bdd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ravi",
        "speaker": "Ravi",
        "sourceStart": 820,
        "sourceEnd": 991,
        "text": "Two bars for the collected weight and a separate table with resident numbers. I will explain that we do not yet have a reliable contamination rate for the whole residence.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "a3ac08d458e2cabd28d494560ab33a5bb9b332d0fb742e7f739267b1457a3284",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 999,
        "sourceEnd": 1052,
        "text": "Are you cancelling the recommendation for extra bins?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "204d30b16e83d5a02dcc0054ea3a9c69484a257737a3aebed6c20f1e91a4b258",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ravi",
        "speaker": "Ravi",
        "sourceStart": 1059,
        "sourceEnd": 1235,
        "text": "No. Overflow was recorded on three evenings, so there is still a reason to add capacity. But I will separate that practical observation from the claim about improved behaviour.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "5bfd52d3e1bf190b05bfea3eee19d2718ae6b8ced100fb9939ce610b2d319571",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1243,
        "sourceEnd": 1347,
        "text": "Send the revised slides by Wednesday. The presentation is on Monday, so we have time to check the units.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "da0fcaa543267417d1f8786bd810674f52bf35cba4fa751166a69752907105e2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
